### Register user 1
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "anjan",
  "email": "anjan@gmail.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "bio": "Java developer from St. Louis"
}

### Register user 2
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "john",
  "email": "john@gmail.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "bio": "Spring Boot enthusiast"
}

### Login as anjan
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "anjan",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Create tweet (replace TOKEN)
POST http://localhost:8080/tweets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJhbmphbiIsImlhdCI6MTc4MDA5MjgyOSwiZXhwIjoxNzgwMTc5MjI5fQ.NhGb_cLwJyOVbtO70s5cjW27r7IyLPPRLhn_IqE2mQY

{
  "content": "Hello Twitter! My first tweet using Spring Boot and JWT!"
}

### Get user profile (public)
GET http://localhost:8080/users/anjan

